  "descriptionHtml": "<p>Саундбар Polk Audio Magnifi Max AX SR — Flagship 7.1.2 Dolby Atmos/DTS:X soundbar system with SDA technology, wireless surrounds and a wireless 10-inch subwoofer. Характеристики ниже — только с страницы/листа производителя.</p>\n<ul><li>Sound format: 7.1.2 Dolby Atmos and DTS:X</li><li>Drivers: 11-driver soundbar array</li><li>Soundbar dimensions: 45 × 4.6 × 2.8 in (W × D × H)</li><li>3 HDMI-in, 1 HDMI eARC, optical in, USB-A for firmware updates, Wi-F</li><li>Subwoofer: 10-inch down-firing wireless subwoofer</li></ul>\n<h2>Характеристики производителя</h2>\n<p><strong>Sound format</strong>: 7.1.2 Dolby Atmos and DTS:X · <strong>Drivers</strong>: 11-driver soundbar array · <strong>Soundbar dimensions</strong>: 45 × 4.6 × 2.8 in (W × D × H) · <strong>Connectivity</strong>: 3 HDMI-in, 1 HDMI eARC, optical in, USB-A for firmware updates, Wi-Fi 802.11 a/n/ac, Bluetooth 5.0 · <strong>Subwoofer</strong>: 10-inch down-firing wireless subwoofer.</p>\n<p>Includes Wi-Fi/Bluetooth streaming, Google Chromecast, Apple AirPlay, Spotify Connect, VoiceAdjust, three 4K HDMI inputs, eARC and optical input.</p>",
